{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/cc1803854cedd8ac04a2bb7716a24988.avif?t=1770922482\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras_big/cc1803854cedd8ac04a2bb7716a24988.avif?t=1770922482 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME ABOARD THE KOHLRABI STARSHIP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to build a new life on your grandmother's greenhouse starship in a cozy, post-apocalyptic galaxy. Ecosystems are exploited, and only a few human settlements remain. But with care and dedication (and your ancestral time-machine) you can restore nature and bring back animals. Travel deep into the galaxy to uncover the mystery behind your grandmother\u2019s disappearance and the ruin of this galaxy, and find love on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/f1e104e10f4d0e3167c1c7173741aa5d.poster.avif?t=1770922482\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/f1e104e10f4d0e3167c1c7173741aa5d.webm?t=1770922482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAMEPLAY\u00a0FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/56cf2c712ede3ff5cdd7d206ad574eee.webp?t=1770922482\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0Customize your spaceship, your planets and yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/4f0e0defec40e99fbf9cf8ff2675b462.webp?t=1770922482\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0Farm, Craft and Mine to repair your spaceship to its old glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/5f151d47df0f9874b081679a2dc7a7fc.webp?t=1770922482\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Explore 5 planets with vastly different ecosystems! (2 in Early Access)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/9eb85052b6183577b9737aa0b9a9d586.webp?t=1770922482\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0Find your match among 8 bachelors and bachelorettes! (4 in Early Access)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/de780c7fc996af685622a15c3a637f36.webp?t=1770922482\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0Tame, name, pet and breed a multitude of cute and alien animals of any fur color!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/386338e6187a370775cae13aa780b30d.webp?t=1770922482\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0Watch nature explode around you when using your time machine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337990/extras/1296dc5c0be8f8afb64304eb63f71fab.webp?t=1770922482\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0Complete your SpeciesDex and learn each species' favorite environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c